rect and regular plans belong to the same mutual fund scheme and generally share the same portfolio and fund manager. They have separate NAVs because their expense structures differ."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Direct plans",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold","children":"Direct plans"}],[["$","p","Direct plans are purchased without a distributor. They generally have a lower expense ratio because distributor commission is not included. The investor takes responsibility for scheme selection, transactions, documentation and ongoing review, or separately engages an appropriate professional.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Direct plans are purchased without a distributor. They generally have a lower expense ratio because distributor commission is not included. The investor takes responsibility for scheme selection, transactions, documentation and ongoing review, or separately engages an appropriate professional."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Regular plans",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold","children":"Regular plans"}],[["$","p","Regular plans are purchased through a Mutual Fund Distributor. The scheme's expenses include distributor commission, so the expense ratio is generally higher than the direct plan of the same scheme.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Regular plans are purchased through a Mutual Fund Distributor. The scheme's expenses include distributor commission, so the expense ratio is generally higher than the direct plan of the same scheme."}],["$","p","Depending on the service arrangement, a distributor may assist with education, paperwork, transactions and ongoing service. The scope should be understood clearly.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Depending on the service arrangement, a distributor may assist with education, paperwork, transactions and ongoing service. The scope should be understood clearly."}]],"$undefined"]}],"$L1d","$L1e"]}],"$L1f"]}]}],"$L20"]}]
